            {"question_number": 3, "question_type": "multiple_choice", "question_text": "What is the best way to name uploaded files on the server?", "options": ["Keep the original filename from the user", "Use the user's username as the filename", "Generate a random UUID or hash as the filename", "Use the current timestamp"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Random filenames (UUIDs) prevent path traversal attacks, filename collisions, and information leakage about the upload content."},
