            {"question_number": 5, "question_type": "multiple_choice", "question_text": "Where should uploaded files be stored?", "options": ["In the same directory as the application code", "In the web root so they can be accessed directly", "Outside the web-accessible directory, accessed through a download endpoint", "In the database as binary data only"], "correct_index": 2, "explanation": "Storing uploads outside the web root prevents direct execution of uploaded scripts. A dedicated endpoint should handle file access with proper permission checks."},
